    "extraction_notes": [
      "P-channel values are transcribed as positive magnitudes; curve quantity labels retain the datasheet negative-sign axes.",
      "Curve points are manual reads from the published figures and are not interpolated.",
      "The transfer figure includes 125 degC, 25 degC, and -55 degC curves; only the 25 degC curve is included.",
      "Fig. 2 does not state VDS, and Fig. 5 does not state VGS or test frequency; these conditions are recorded as unspecified rather than inferred from the table.",
      "The strict schema has no fields for gate charge, reverse-recovery time, gate leakage, zero-gate drain current, thermal resistance, or maximum-rated companion values; those published fields are not represented.",
      "The datasheet reports RDS(on) maximum values of 0.340 ohm at VGS = -10 V, ID = -1.25 A and 0.550 ohm at VGS = -4.5 V, ID = -1.0 A; the strict rdson_points schema stores the corresponding typical values."
